  _created: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b99cefb3e1baa5e42af6740fc66ddd6b, type: 2}
  _charactersPerSecond: 40
  _intro:
  - ...Can you hear me?
  - Your life on Earth has ended. I am sorry. It ended far too soon.
  - But your soul has not been lost. It has been chosen.
  - You will be reborn in another world, where strength can be seen, measured, and
    grown.
  - Before you go, shape the body you will wake up in.
  _outro:
  - '{name}. A good name.'
  - Remember this form. It is yours now, in the new world and for the rest of your
    new life.
  - Go. Live well.
  _advanceKey:
    m_Name: Advance
